# runtime/tests inventory.
#
# Why this file exists: as of 8f13560c this directory held 21 items and exactly one
# of them ran. Seven probes had runner scripts that nothing invoked, five files had
# no runner at all, and tests/gc_unit is behind a default-OFF option. A probe that is
# present but never runs looks exactly like a probe that passes.
#
# runtime/CMakeLists.txt fails the build if a file here is missing from this list, or
# if a line here names a file that is gone. Adding a probe that nothing runs is still
# allowed -- it just has to be said out loud, on one line, with a reason.
#
# status:
#   configure  run by runtime/CMakeLists.txt on every configure (no extra step)
#   manual     runnable, but needs something a configure cannot have: a built runtime
#              SO, an explicit cpuset, or fault injection. Invoked by a gate, not by
#              the build. MUST name what it needs.
#   orphan     no runner at all. Debt: either give it one or delete it.
#
# Directories count too: tests/gc_unit is a whole suite behind a default-OFF option,
# and the first version of this check globbed only *.cpp/*.cj/*.sh, so it was invisible
# to the accounting that exists to make exactly that visible.
#
# <file>                                  <status>   <what it needs / why it is here>

slot_type_split_compile_probe.cpp         configure  three-arm negative compile gate for HeapSlot/RootSlot/DerivedSlot
mark_generation_compile_probe.cpp         configure  control plus young-as-old and old-as-young negative compile gates for MarkView
colour_state_machine_probe.cpp            configure  compile-time colour state machine table: 32-epoch formula equivalence against a literal copy, DROP_BIT collision counts (None/Ghost must be 0, each family > 0), and three inject arms

run_colour_table_witness.sh               manual     host g++/clang++ with C++14 only; prints the readable collision witness and per-family counts. Judgement is the configure arm above
run_colour_predicates_unit.sh             manual     host g++/clang++ with C++14 only; 17 ZGC-named predicates x positive/negative words, 32 mask epochs, and 16 phase-colour rows
colour_predicates_unit.cpp                manual     harness for run_colour_predicates_unit.sh; frozen externally for the remove-all-four-files negative arm

run_stack_watermark_probe.sh              manual     built runtime SO + cpuset; has its own injection arm
run_stack_exposure_probe.sh               manual     built runtime SO + cpuset; 6 cases
run_stack_grow_probe.sh                   manual     built runtime SO + cpuset; 6 cases
run_object_size_guard_probe.sh            manual     built runtime SO + cpuset + fault injection
run_mutator_lock_liveness_probe.sh        manual     source-text structural check; awk-parses source order
run_epoch_handshake_protocol_probe.sh     manual     g++ only + cpuset; old/new PROTOCOL_FIXED arms
run_threadlocal_init_race_probe.sh        manual     g++ -fsanitize=thread + cpuset
run_typeinfo_reuse_probe.sh               manual     built runtime SO; dlopen/dlclose address-reuse positive/negative arms plus measured registeredTypeInfos RSS
run_elf_unload_quiescence.sh              manual     testable product runtime SO + Cangjie SDK; real dylib unload reader/directory/type/static-root groups and public PackageInfo snapshot traversal
run_zgc_self_heal_loop_probe.sh           manual     built runtime SO; scripts a lost CAS to drive the ported ZBarrier::self_heal loop through its :103-107 retry and :98-101 fast-path-exit arms, which the workload leaves cold
run_string_dedup_product.sh               manual     rebuilt std.core module + product SO + runtime SO; full/range, detach, unequal, and 32-way concurrent request arms

stack_watermark_harness.cpp               manual     harness for run_stack_watermark_probe.sh
stack_exposure_harness.cpp                manual     harness for run_stack_exposure_probe.sh
stack_grow_harness.cpp                    manual     harness for run_stack_grow_probe.sh
object_size_guard_harness.cpp             manual     harness for run_object_size_guard_probe.sh
mutator_lock_liveness_harness.cpp         manual     harness for run_mutator_lock_liveness_probe.sh
epoch_handshake_protocol_harness.cpp      manual     harness for run_epoch_handshake_protocol_probe.sh
threadlocal_init_race_harness.cpp         manual     harness for run_threadlocal_init_race_probe.sh
typeinfo_reuse_harness.cpp                manual     harness for run_typeinfo_reuse_probe.sh
typeinfo_reuse_plugin.cpp                 manual     pair of dlopen/dlclose images for TypeInfo virtual-address reuse
elf_unload_quiescence_harness.cpp         manual     real product SO unload-chain group assertions and deterministic held-reader rendezvous
elf_unload_quiescence_plugin.cj            manual     Cangjie dylib with package/type/function descriptor/static root unload surfaces
package_snapshot_public.cj                 manual     SDK public PackageInfo.load/subPackages/getSubPackage traversal over snapshot handles
package_snapshot_root.cj                   manual     root package for prefix-equivalent snapshot enumeration
package_snapshot_branch.cj                 manual     intermediate package whose snapshot must expose its own descendants
package_snapshot_leaf_r.cj                 manual     first leaf under the snapshot branch
package_snapshot_leaf_t.cj                 manual     sibling leaf under the snapshot branch
package_snapshot_sibling.cj                manual     leaf sibling of the snapshot branch
package_snapshot_subpackages_negative.patch manual    product fault injection: disconnect snapshot subpackages from the native getter
elf_unload_queue_blocker.cj                manual     second-image Cangjie task occupies the sole processor so target-image entry remains queued
elf_unload_gc_entry.cj                     manual     MRT_CjRuntimeInit path with deterministic managed roots for the real GC stack entry
elf_unload_skip_handshake_negative.patch  manual     product fault injection: omit shared reader drain; GcEntryReader and ReaderUse must fail
elf_unload_remove_package_negative.patch  manual     product fault injection: retain package directory entries; only Directory must fail
elf_unload_gc_entry_negative.patch        manual     product fault injection: disconnect the real GC stack-root entry; only GcEntryReader must fail
elf_unload_active_frame_negative.patch    manual     product fault injection: bypass active-image rejection; only NativeFrameReject must fail
elf_unload_queued_task_negative.patch     manual     product fault injection: bypass queued image-entry rejection; only QueuedTaskReject must fail
elf_unload_direct_order_negative.patch    manual     product fault injection: put purge before direct-callback handshake; all four direct modes must fail at their common convergence
elf_unload_direct_active_negative.patch   manual     product fault injection: omit direct callback active-frame decision; only DirectActiveProtection mode must fail
elf_unload_direct_queued_negative.patch   manual     product fault injection: omit direct callback pending-task wait; only DirectQueuedProtection must fail
elf_unload_world_stopped_negative.patch   manual     product fault injection: accept unrelated STW as purge authorization; only DirectUnrelatedStw mode must fail
elf_unload_early_return_negative.patch    manual     product fault injection: report missing unload handler as success; only EarlyReturnNoPurge must fail
elf_unload_remove_roots_negative.patch    manual     product fault injection: retain static-root registration; only StaticRoots must fail
elf_unload_remove_type_negative.patch     manual     product fault injection: retain type-index entries; only TypeIndex must fail
elf_unload_unlink_image_negative.patch    manual     product fault injection: retain linked-image identity; only ReaderUse must fail
elf_unload_shutdown_authorization_negative.patch manual product fault injection: disconnect shutdown purge authorization; only the finalizer-trigger shutdown entry must fail
elf_unload_compatible_preinit_negative.patch manual product fault injection: bypass the shared compatible-package early return; every LoadCJLibraryWithInit mode fails while plain direct modes stay green
zgc_self_heal_loop_unit.cpp               manual     harness for run_zgc_self_heal_loop_probe.sh
string_dedup_product.cj                   manual     product String.deduplicated() backing-identity witness via unsafe rawData mutation
string_dedup_product_cut.diff             manual     product fault injection: disconnect String.deduplicated() from canonicalizeString and rebuild std.core SO
string_dedup_same_length_negative.patch   manual     product fault injection: weaken canonical equality to length-only; only the same-length distinct-content guard must fail
typeinfo_remove_negative.patch            manual     fault injection: remove both unload-path RemoveTypeInfosInRange calls for the negative runtime

epoch_handshake_foreign_churn.cpp         orphan     no runner; foreign-N2C churn against the epoch handshake
epoch_handshake_stress.cj                 orphan     no runner; Cangjie-side epoch handshake stress
remembered_set_erase_range_harness.cpp    orphan     no runner; RememberedSet::EraseRange
varray_hasreffield_unit.cpp               orphan     no runner; VArray HasRefField false-negative unit
objm_uleb_overshift_unit.cpp              orphan     no runner; BUG-23 overlong ULEB shift>=70 unit
objm_nativealloc_zero_unit.cpp            orphan     no runner; BUG-24 NativeAlloc(0) Index underflow unit
objm_generic_null_ti_unit.cpp             orphan     no runner; BUG-22 constrained generic null TypeInfo unit
objm_fieldinfo_malloc_unit.cpp            orphan     no runner; BUG-21 FieldInfo malloc-null OOM unit
objm_same_root_package_unit.cpp           orphan     no runner; SUSPECT-02 IsSameRootPackage NUL walk unit
rtown_threadcache_tls_unit.cpp            orphan     no runner; BUG-20 ThreadCache TLS leak unit
rtown_mtable_publish_unit.cpp             orphan     no runner; BUG-18 MTable publish race unit
rtown_functable_cache_unit.cpp            orphan     no runner; BUG-19 functable cache UAF unit

gc_unit                                   manual     whole GTest suite; runs only with -DMRT_GC_UNIT_TESTS=ON, which nothing sets -- so today nothing runs it. Build-time cost of turning it on has not been measured; do that before flipping the default
gcparity                                  manual     built runtime SO + official control SO + official/selfhost cjc + cpuset; REPORT-gcparity release matrix and beats-official survival/allocation matrix (run_matrix.sh)
perf_vs_official                          manual     built subject/official SDKs + private cpuset; release comparison matrix is run explicitly, not during configure
interp_sentinel_probe.cpp                 manual     built runtime SO; hunt-stackmap BUG2 interpreter-sentinel decode (pre-fix SEGV / post-fix FillInterpretedFrameDesc)
